# Every text file is LF in the working tree as in the index, whatever core.autocrlf says: agents rewrite files, and
# a mixed LF/CRLF tree made every rewrite flip a file's endings and every git call warn (owner, 2026-09-30).
* text=auto eol=lf

# The zig wrappers used by `just check-mac`: a shell script with CRLF breaks its shebang, a .cmd with LF
# trips older cmd.exe parsing. Pin both, whatever core.autocrlf says.
tools/mac-cc/*.sh text eol=lf
tools/mac-cc/*.cmd text eol=crlf
